( https://albiononline.com/news/europe-founder-packs-available )

Adventurer,

*Albion Europe* ( https://albiononline.com/europe ) launches *April 29* , o=
ffering a fresh start in an untouched gameworld, brand-new Founder Packs, a=
nd more. But a huge release like this needs a proper video - so, obviously,=
 that=E2=80=99s just what we=E2=80=99ve done!

Watch the *live action trailer* here, and scroll down to find out more abou=
t the new Albion Europe Founder Packs. Oh, and please do let us know if the=
 trailer reminds you of anything=E2=80=A6

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DxPyw4nZlGNA )

Founder Pack Rewards
--------------------

*Albion Europe Founder Packs* ( https://albiononline.com/europe#founderpack=
s ) allow you to choose between the paths of light and darkness with a rang=
e of exclusive vanity items. Pick up a Light Founder Pack and become the vi=
rtuous *Paragon* with a mighty *Armored Pegasus* , or choose a Dark Founder=
 Pack to be a sinister *Harbinger* with an *Armored Shadow Pegasus*. And if=
 you want the choice of both, there=E2=80=99s nothing stopping you grabbing=
 one of each!

These Founder Packs offer a lot more than vanity, too. Each includes *Premi=
um* and *Gold* , as well as offering *early access to the new server* and a=
ccess to the *Closed Beta*. And each Founder Pack allows you to *reserve on=
e or more character and guild name* , depending on the tier of pack you own=
.

( https://albiononline.com/europe#founderpacks )

Albion Europe Founder Packs are upgradable , so if you later decide you wan=
t a higher tier pack with greater rewards, you only need to pay the differe=
nce in price. And owning both a light and dark pack gets you the rewards fr=
om each.
For a complete overview of the Albion Europe Founder Packs, click here ( ht=
tps://albiononline.com/europe#founderpacks ).

SEE FOUNDER PACKS ( https://albiononline.com/europe#founderpacks )

Get 1,000 Gold Per Referral
---------------------------

On top of all that, when you refer a friend you can claim a massive *1,000 =
Gold* if their first ever purchase is an Albion Europe Founder Pack!
This is of course in addition to all the other rewards available in a Refer=
ral Season, like the monthly Referral Mount - so let your friends know toda=
y!

